Bind Npc 31550 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 31551 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 621 "Subjugation Squad of the Goblin Village"
    Journal for karus "You must talk to [Goblin Subjugation Squad] Raul. "
    Journal for elmorad "You must talk to [Goblin Subjugation Squad] Welz."

Requires player level >= 60

Rewards none

On available
    Say "Master, have you heard of the [Goblin Subjugation Squad]? They are a special dispatch of troops created to subjugate Goblins by residing around Goblin villages.  You can receive your mission from them.  So why don't you go?"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "How are you? I am Raul of the [Goblin Subjugation Squad]. We are currently subjugating Goblins nearby in obedience to the King his majesty's orders."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "We have moblized the troops because the number of Goblin attacks has drastically increased recently.\n\nSo with various situations, we are trying to repel the increasing number of Goblins.  <selfname>, why don't you fulfill your responsiblity as a citizen of Karus by joining us?\n\nNear  Goblin Squad of town Goblin Karus area to talk with Raul."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "How are you? I am Wells of the [Goblin Subjugation Squad]. We are currently subjugating Goblins nearby in obedience to the King his majesty's orders."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "We have moblized the troops because the number of Goblin attacks has drastically increased recently.\n\nSo with various situations, we are trying to repel the increasing number of Goblins.  <selfname>, why don't you fulfill your responsiblity as a citizen of El Morad by joining us?\n\nEl Morad near the villages of the region Goblin [is conversation with Wells Goblin Squad],."

On claimable
    Show quest "Good. The number of Kobold has been increasing recently. Please start by subjugating them first."
